 "summary": "FINAL, from approved animatic v3: same story, beats, staging and timing. Scene A (intro, 0:00-0:11 and the end card) and scene D (ratings, 0:29-0:33.5) re-rendered at full steps (20) instead of lightning, 2 takes each. A: take 1 picked by the critic (take 2 had a stray floating hand and baton on the empty ramp). D: take 2 picked by eye (wider Foundry behind the kid, smudge and board visible; the critic hit Gemini 429). Two-shot, fight and lip-synced CU were already full quality. The full-cut critic review also hit 429, so the final is checked by frames only; the critic's note on A (mouth lag on 'No sponsor. No record.', weightless baton, static empty-ramp hold) is not addressed since J asked to keep v3's beats. Still 1:1 scenes padded into 1080x1920 (Gen's portrait enum fails). Spend about $5.60 of $6.03.",
